ent-MobWH40KChaosBomber = chaos bomber
    .desc = A heretic who lobs fragmentation grenades and uses a combat knife at close range.
ent-MobWH40KChaosBruiser = chaos bruiser
    .desc = An armored heretic who closes in and batters enemies with a brutal melee weapon.
ent-MobWH40KChaosFlamer = chaos flamer
    .desc = A heretic closing in to spray burning promethium at short range, with a melee weapon for enemies within reach.
ent-MobWH40KChaosGunner = chaos gunner
    .desc = A heavily armored heretic laying down rapid laser fire and using a combat knife at close range.
ent-MobWH40KChaosMauler = chaos mauler
    .desc = A slow, heavily armored executioner whose heavy swings briefly stun their victims.
ent-MobWH40KChaosRager = chaos rager
    .desc = A fast berserker resistant to ordinary blades and bullets, but vulnerable to powered chain weapons and armor piercing attacks.
ent-MobWH40KChaosShooter = chaos shooter
    .desc = A heretic armed with a lasgun and a combat knife for close quarters.
ent-MobWH40KChaosShotgunner = chaos shotgunner
    .desc = A heretic firing volleys of shotgun pellets, switching to a combat knife at close range.
ent-MobWH40KChaosStalker = chaos stalker
    .desc = A lightly armored skirmisher dangerous with both lasgun and blade, but less durable than other heretics.
ent-MobWH40KChaosTrapper = chaos trapper
    .desc = A heretic throwing bolas that exhaust and restrain victims, with a melee weapon for close quarters.
ent-WH40KChaosFlame = promethium flame
    .desc = Burning promethium.
ent-WH40KChaosShotgunPellet = shotgun pellet
    .desc = A shotgun pellet.
ent-WH40KChaosShotgunSpread = shotgun pellets
    .desc = A volley of shotgun pellets.
ent-WH40KChaosFragGrenade = chaos fragmentation grenade
    .desc = A fragmentation grenade thrown by a heretic.
ent-WH40KChaosBola = chaos shock bola
    .desc = A bola that exhausts and restrains its victim on impact.

wh40k-chaos-grenade-warning = The bomber prepares to throw a grenade!
